    description: Some("A Supercharger-cassette fixed shooter: mutants hatch from a rank of drifting eggs laid by the Mother Creature — an alien driven mad by irradiated vodka — and your cannon holds the ground below. The cassette\'s extra memory pays for toggleable twists standard carts couldn\'t fit: shields, time warp, penetrating and guided fire, and up to four players taking turns."),
